{
  "id": "atelier-sample-hold",
  "name": "Atelier — Sample & Hold",
  "description": "Séquence aléatoire façon Berlin school : une horloge échantillonne du bruit via un Sample & Hold, un quantizer met le résultat en gamme, et ça pilote le pitch. Le filtre dérive lentement avec un LFO.",
  "group": "Atelier Signal",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      { "id": "clk", "type": "clock", "name": "Clock", "position": { "x": 40, "y": 60 }, "params": { "running": true, "tempo": 110, "rate": 4, "swing": 0 } },
      { "id": "noise", "type": "noise", "name": "Bruit (source)", "position": { "x": 40, "y": 320 }, "params": { "level": 1.0, "noiseType": "white", "stereo": 0, "pan": 0 } },
      { "id": "sh", "type": "sample-hold", "name": "Sample & Hold", "position": { "x": 360, "y": 60 }, "params": { "mode": 0 } },
      { "id": "quant", "type": "quantizer", "name": "Gamme (penta)", "position": { "x": 620, "y": 60 }, "params": { "root": 0, "scale": 7 } },
      { "id": "osc", "type": "oscillator", "name": "Voix", "position": { "x": 880, "y": 60 }, "params": { "frequency": 110, "type": "sawtooth", "pwm": 0.5, "unison": 1, "detune": 0, "fmLin": 0, "fmExp": 0, "subMix": 0.2, "subOct": 1 } },
      { "id": "lfo", "type": "lfo", "name": "Dérive coupure", "position": { "x": 880, "y": 320 }, "params": { "rate": 0.07, "depth": 0.5, "offset": 0.3, "shape": "triangle", "bipolar": false } },
      { "id": "vcf", "type": "vcf", "name": "Filtre", "position": { "x": 1140, "y": 60 }, "params": { "cutoff": 900, "resonance": 0.4, "drive": 0.08, "envAmount": 0, "modAmount": 0.6, "keyTrack": 0, "model": "svf", "mode": "lp", "slope": 24 } },
      { "id": "delay", "type": "delay", "name": "Delay", "position": { "x": 1400, "y": 60 }, "params": { "time": 330, "feedback": 0.4, "mix": 0.3, "tone": 0.6, "pingPong": true } },
      { "id": "rev", "type": "reverb", "name": "Reverb", "position": { "x": 1660, "y": 60 }, "params": { "time": 1.8, "damp": 0.5, "preDelay": 20, "mix": 0.28 } },
      { "id": "out", "type": "output", "name": "Out", "position": { "x": 1920, "y": 60 }, "params": { "level": 0.7 } },
      { "id": "notes", "type": "notes", "name": "Info", "position": { "x": 360, "y": 320 }, "params": { "text": "SAMPLE & HOLD (Berlin school)\n\nLa clé : CLOCK → S&H (trig) et BRUIT → S&H (in). À chaque tic d'horloge, le S&H fige une valeur aléatoire du bruit. Le QUANTIZER la met en gamme → pitch. On obtient la séquence aléatoire stepped classique. Un LFO lent fait dériver la coupure du filtre.\n\nÀ explorer : le rate de l'horloge (vitesse), root/scale du quantizer, la résonance du filtre, le feedback du delay." } }
    ],
    "connections": [
      { "from": { "moduleId": "clk", "portId": "clock" }, "to": { "moduleId": "sh", "portId": "trig" }, "kind": "sync" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "noise", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "sh", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "sh", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "quant", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "quant", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "osc", "portId": "pitch" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "osc", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "vcf", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "lfo", "portId": "cv-out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "vcf", "portId": "mod" }, "kind": "cv" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "vcf", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "delay", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "delay", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "rev", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" },
      { "from": { "moduleId": "rev", "portId": "out" }, "to": { "moduleId": "out", "portId": "in" }, "kind": "audio" }
    ]
  }
}
